(26, 12, '1 lot', 'Repair and supply of Materials<br />\r\nScope of Works:<br />\r\n1. Fiber Break Location<br />\r\n- Light Source Testing and Troubleshooting<br />\r\n2. Fiber Splicing and Testing<br />\r\n- Re-splicing Fiber Optic Cable and OTDR Testing<br />\r\n3. Documentation and Report<br />\r\n4. Test<br />\r\n5. Experiment'),
(27, 11, '1 lot', 'Branded Desktop Computer with following specs:<br />\r\n-Processor: Core i5 equivalent or better<br />\r\n-Memory: 16GB RAM<br />\r\n-Graphics: Intel UHD Graphics equivalent or better<br />\r\n-Monitor: >= 21\", 1920x1080 Resolution<br />\r\nInclusions:<br />\r\n-Operating System: Windows 11<br />\r\n-UPS 800VA<br />\r\n-Webcam: 1080P USB, plug and play<br />\r\n-Headset<br />\r\n-USB Wired keyboard & mouse<br />\r\n-Warranty: 1 year equivalent or better');
